{"id": "t073-002", "text": "Aditi's dad had a fall on Tuesday evening and fractured his wrist. She's driving up to Leeds tomorrow morning to stay with him for a few days. He's refusing to use the sling and her mum is apparently at the end of her tether with him. Aditi said she'll be back on Sunday night, and she'd love a walk on Monday to decompress.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aditi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fall", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday evening", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fractured his wrist", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving up to Leeds", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow morning", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few days", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "at the end of her tether", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aditi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday night", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "love a walk", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday"}]}
{"id": "t073-007", "text": "Stefan's mum has her hip replacement on the 14th at half 8 in the morning. He's taking the whole week off and staying with her afterwards. Don't forget to send him a message that evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Stefan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip replacement", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 14th at half 8 in the morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking the whole week off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying with her", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him a message", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t073-012", "text": "Spoke to Reza after the match. His daughter Zara broke her arm at trampolining on Saturday morning. She's in a cast for six weeks and he says she's mostly upset about missing the swimming gala the week after. His wife is taking her to the fracture clinic on Friday at 9:30, and Reza's covering the school run that morning. Zara wants everyone to sign her cast.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reza", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the match"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "broke her arm", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "trampolining", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in a cast", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "six weeks"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "mostly upset", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "swimming gala", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fracture clinic", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at 9:30", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Reza", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants everyone to sign her cast", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t073-016", "text": "Chioma's mum is in hospital again with her chest. Chioma is flying to Lagos on the 3rd, first thing in the morning, and won't be back until the 17th. She's quite worried but trying to keep it together. Her brother is already there and sending updates. Remind me to message her on the 4th once she's landed and settled, and again the day before she flies home.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chioma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chioma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying to Lagos", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd, first thing in the morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the 17th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "quite worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying to keep it together", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 4th once she's landed and settled", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flies home", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t073-020", "text": "Gintaras has been struggling since his surgery. The wound got infected and he's back on antibiotics until the 22nd. Remind me to pop round with some soup on Thursday evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gintaras", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surgery", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wound got infected", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "antibiotics", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "until the 22nd", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pop round with some soup", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t073-021", "text": "Jaya told me her son Arjun has glandular fever. He's missed two weeks of college and she's worried he'll fall behind before his mocks in January.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jaya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arjun", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "glandular fever", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "two weeks"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "college", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "mocks", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t073-022", "text": "Samir's big presentation is Monday at 9am and he's really nervous about it. Text him good luck on Sunday night, then ask how it went that afternoon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Samir", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "big presentation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday at 9am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text him good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday night", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how it went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that afternoon", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t073-023", "text": "Dong said his wife is expecting again, due in early April. She's had terrible morning sickness this time round. He's being very sweet about it all, doing every school run and cooking all the meals because she can't face the smell of onions. Their eldest, Ali, is excited about being a big brother.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dong", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early April", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrible morning sickness", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't face the smell of onions", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "eldest", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ali", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t073-024", "text": "Aidan and Julien are off to Lisbon on the 9th. Aidan is pescatarian, Julien will eat literally anything. They fly back the following Tuesday. Julien's mum is house-sitting and looking after their cat Pesto while they're away. Aidan asked me to recommend somewhere for seafood, so I should send him that list from my trip.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aidan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Lisbon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 9th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aidan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "pescatarian", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "eat literally anything", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the following Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Pesto", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "while they're away", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aidan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him that list from my trip", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t073-026", "text": "Sadia's dog Biscuit had to have a tooth out yesterday. She was more stressed than Biscuit was. The vet wants to see him again a week after.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "have a tooth out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week after", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t073-030", "text": "Quick note: Stefan prefers red wine, Gareth only drinks lager, and Petra is teetotal.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Stefan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "prefers red wine", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gareth", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "only drinks lager", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Petra", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "teetotal", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t073-031", "text": "Grace called back. Theo's temperature finally broke last night and he went back to nursery this morning. Huge relief.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Grace", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "temperature", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Huge relief", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t073-034", "text": "Zara's ninth birthday party is the Saturday after next, from 2 till 4. She's obsessed with axolotls at the moment, so anything axolotl themed would be perfect.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "ninth birthday party", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Saturday after next, from 2 till 4", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "axolotls", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "anything axolotl themed would be perfect", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t073-038", "text": "Julien is cooking a full French dinner for his parents' anniversary on the 18th. Forty years married. He's been practising the beef bourguignon every weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Julien", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "full French dinner", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "anniversary", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 18th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Forty years married", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every weekend"}]}
{"id": "t073-042", "text": "Liam's dad is home from hospital now. The doctors want him back for a follow-up scan on the 2nd in the morning. Liam's going with him and then working from home that afternoon. His mum wants a quiet Sunday lunch for the family the weekend after, and Liam said his dad is already demanding roast potatoes despite the new low-salt diet.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Liam", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "home from hospital", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "follow-up scan", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 2nd in the morning", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Liam", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that afternoon", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "quiet Sunday lunch", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend after", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Liam", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "low-salt diet", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t073-044", "text": "Siddharth (Sid to everyone) has a nut allergy, the serious EpiPen kind. Check the bakery labels before ordering the cake for his leaving drinks on Friday at 5.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Siddharth", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sid", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nut allergy, the serious EpiPen kind", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Check the bakery labels", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before ordering the cake", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at 5", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t073-049", "text": "Aidan hasn't been himself lately. His mum's dementia is getting worse and he's going to see her every Sunday afternoon now. He said he'd like to get out for a pint sometime, so I should invite him for Thursday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aidan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hasn't been himself", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "lately"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dementia", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every Sunday afternoon"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "like to get out for a pint", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "invite him", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t073-054", "text": "Ivan Petrov twisted his ankle playing five-a-side on Tuesday night. He's on crutches and furious about missing the derby on the 12th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ivan Petrov", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "twisted his ankle", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "five-a-side", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "on crutches", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "furious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "derby", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 12th", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t073-057", "text": "Had coffee with Kasia and Zara this morning. Zara's mum is in hospital with pneumonia and Kasia is covering her shifts all week. Zara's visiting her each evening after work. Kasia is going in on Friday at 6 too. I need to message Zara on Saturday morning to see how her mum is doing, and maybe drop off some food the day after.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pneumonia", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "covering her shifts", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "all week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "each evening after work"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kasia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at 6"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message Zara", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday morning", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop off some food", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "a2"}]}
